WEBVTT

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:10.939
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:11.189 --> 00:00:16.186
Type "Naira" in the Search box.

00:00:16.436 --> 00:00:21.299
Click Edit Counting Money in Naira.

00:00:21.549 --> 00:00:27.549
Check that the Title says
what viewers will learn.

00:00:29.269 --> 00:00:35.269
Type "Learn how to count and compare naira
notes and coins." in the Description box.

00:00:38.165 --> 00:00:42.215
Tick Maths.

00:00:42.465 --> 00:00:48.066
Type "naira, money,
counting" in the Tags box.

00:00:48.316 --> 00:00:53.916
Select G from the Maturity rating list.

00:00:54.166 --> 00:00:58.016
Click Save changes.

00:00:58.266 --> 00:01:04.196
Wait until you see Changes saved.
